experiencing an exciting amount of growth to better serve our customers.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270943047970001.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Why Choose Us </strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270943096359813.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p>High efficiency, perfect service system and competitive price are the core of our company</p><p><strong>6.  Application</strong></p><p>1. Sewage treatment, agriculture, construction, water circulate, tunnel, bridge, river</p><p>2. Fish ponds, swimming pool, pond, rain, infiltration water</p><p>3. Water supply, engineering, sewerage, waste water engineering, water source, surface water</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270943123219017.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Package and Shipping</strong></p><p><strong>Packaging Details:</strong></p><p>·Cubic/ cylinder carton</p><p>·Plywood box</p><p>·According to yours requirement.</p><p><strong>Delivery Detail:</strong></p><p>·Depend on the pumps' order date.</p><p>·Usually about 20-30 days.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270943163964074.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: Where is your factory located?</strong></p><p>A: Our factory is located in Daxi town, Weling, Taizhou, Zhejiang province, China. Wenling is a convenient transport with its closest Ningbo port and Luqiao airport. Besides, Daxi is near the 104 National Highway.</p><p><strong>2. Q: How can I get some samples?</strong></p><p>A: Usually we can’t offer free sample, pls pay the sample and express fee. However, the competitive price will be offered in your large order.</p><p><strong>3. Q: How about the warranty of your products？</strong></p><p>A: The warranty of our products is one year. Within this period, you will be offered new spare parts for replacement for free. And the best solution will be g